action,x,y,origin,button,key,micros,note,platform
# P20 on Android: the nested menu walked by label to level three. The menus are platform PopupMenus; FrontWindows finds
# them through WindowInspector (1ba5e444), so taplabel reaches their rows.
# The disabled item is pressed first and must do nothing: "THIS MUST NOT HAPPEN" never appears.
# Pass: "level 3 toggle -> true" after the first walk, then "last action -> level 2" after the second.
# P20-open-the-nested-menu keeps the capture of the open first level.
# P20 在 Android 上：以文字一路走到第三層。先按停用項目，不得有任何作用。通過:level 3 toggle -> true,之後 last action -> level 2。
sleep,,,,,,1500000,let P20 render,android
taplabel,,,,,Open the menu,,,android
sleep,,,,,,1200000,,android
taplabel,,,,,Disabled item,,must do nothing,android
sleep,,,,,,800000,,android
key,,,,,escape,,close whatever is left open,android
sleep,,,,,,800000,,android
taplabel,,,,,Open the menu,,,android
sleep,,,,,,1200000,,android
taplabel,,,,,Level 2 submenu,,,android
sleep,,,,,,1200000,,android
taplabel,,,,,Level 3 submenu,,,android
sleep,,,,,,1200000,,android
taplabel,,,,,Level 3 toggle,,level 3 toggle -> true,android
sleep,,,,,,1200000,,android
key,,,,,escape,,close the menu if the check item left it open,android
sleep,,,,,,800000,,android
taplabel,,,,,Open the menu,,,android
sleep,,,,,,1200000,,android
taplabel,,,,,Level 2 submenu,,,android
sleep,,,,,,1200000,,android
taplabel,,,,,Level 2 item,,last action -> level 2,android
sleep,,,,,,1500000,,android
